{"parentUuid":"c6605273-c957-4169-98d8-92bed20b26f2","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14989107 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"18f41961-6b43-452c-90ce-72b5aa472a49","timestamp":"2026-10-28T04:29:01.713Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14989107 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"e071936d-eecf-4712-8180-225a10b3edb2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/jarod/Code/personal/jarodtaylor.com","sessionId":"e071936d-eecf-4712-8180-225a10b3edb2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"generic-pondering-plum"}
{"parentUuid":"18f41961-6b43-452c-90ce-72b5aa472a49","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgU1Em8AbYfunzieKv45X","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Your pick:** the two light Baseplate options are open at http://localhost:8710/r7/blocks/, as 2a and 2b.\n\n1. **2a, warm paper:**\n   - a cream ground with near-white tiles\n   - the T is solid cobalt and the J is persimmon, so the monogram is a bold two-colour mark\n   - \"behind the work.\" is in rust\n   - It feels warm, like a print piece.\n2. **2b, cool white:**\n   - a pale blue-white ground\n   - the T stays paper-white with cobalt edges and the J is persimmon, close to your original\n   - \"behind the work.\" is in cobalt\n   - It feels crisper and more digital.\n\n**Both have:**\n- no orange slabs\n- the roles in the name tile, under your name\n- a dark ink tile for the bio\n- the bricks nav and socials\n\nContrast passes AA on paper (lowest 5.4:1); the build's contrast check confirms it when it's ported.\n\n**My pick is 2a.** The solid cobalt T gives the monogram more weight on light, and the warm paper makes it look less like Clean.\n\nThe roles in these screenshots are at the old size; the one-step-smaller size applies in the real build."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":167,"cache_read_input_tokens":290501,"output_tokens":395,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":167,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":395,"cache_read_input_tokens":290501,"cache_creation_input_tokens":167,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":167},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_tr